{"version":1,"key":"card:30","content":{"id":30,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c16ae134-3eab-423b-8014-71c077cff593","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记忆分为两种机制：存储和提取。存储和提取是呈负相关的，存储过程越容易，则提取过程就会越困难。举两个例子："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"96267c41-1731-4f78-8065-aa33f5bf159b","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ceb08ec5-db4a-4b6d-b714-206c77a1ad38","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"092182b6-05c1-4a5e-88e5-84b47a2ecb28","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"课堂笔记。有的同学时边听讲边记笔记，记笔记这个过程就是存储过程，像这种未加思考的存储过程，是相当容易的，但是提取过程就会比较困难，过了一段时间，可能就完全不记得笔记上的内容了。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"7a276fa1-2ed4-45c6-862c-f067ff843cd3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"257305b5-5d74-43d9-8d4f-3d5ad7daf5e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阅读笔记。在读书时，会直接在书本上进行划线标记重点，这种没有任何加工的存储，提取也是比较困难的，过了一段时间，你完全不会意识到划线的内容是什么。有的时候还会重复阅读，但如果仅仅是阅读一遍而没有任何思考，过了一段时间还是容易忘记。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"69bf7014-9284-4512-8ff7-1ef9c7df68b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基于此，我们要求存储的过程存在一定的难度，这样才能保证在提取知识是比较轻松，这就是必要难度理论。现在的问题是，如何让存储有难度呢？重点在于一定要有思考，不是机械的摘抄，要用自己的语言复述一遍。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"08878086-cadc-4a5f-a9f2-cb9000a50aa1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还是以上面两个例子举例："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"56178cb9-d4cd-4380-89d7-e9d51c474852","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"fba961d6-d801-4575-b53f-ca625c9f8fe3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cf3bda2f-7560-4687-bd8c-1b7354026526","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不要机械的抄写黑板上的内容，不如好好听讲，等到课后，用自己的语言将课堂内容复述一遍"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"fde9eea8-9e33-4678-9653-1deaed3d8530","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2a47f671-ceed-4dd8-8ee1-b9399212d828","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在阅读的过程中，一定要有所记录，对于精彩或重点的部分，我们要用自己的语言复述一遍"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d6e58135-c1f8-4b2c-be8b-7fd9fe189dba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的两个例子，都强调不是简单的摘抄，而是用自己的语言复述一遍记录下面，添加这么一道复述的工序，会让存储的过程不再是那么的简单，我们记忆的会更加的深刻。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"66b42dde-8665-40c9-8a03-3e61ee9edff1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"cf782260-989c-4641-8033-6fb2ea0af920","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6b036e97-c01b-4249-8d75-e36c3119a980","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7b9c6776-b633-4168-b59b-25e3778baa1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《卡片笔记写作法》"}]}]}]}],"tags":["学习方法"],"createTime":1688953292717,"updateTime":1792511074790,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792511074790}}